# AstRS frozen protocol prefix — the append-only proof (blueprint §7.2).
#
# This file is a VERBATIM COPY of tests/golden/protocol.snap taken at the moment
# the consumer-side route vocabulary (NodeEvent::InputRouteUpgrade /
# InputRouteDowngrade) was appended. It is NEVER regenerated.
#
# tests/protocol_snapshot.rs asserts that every section of the live snapshot
# *begins with* the lines recorded here, in order. protocol.snap answers "did
# anything change?" and has to be regenerated for an intended tail append;
# this file answers the stronger question "did anything already frozen move?"
# and must not. A future append adds lines to protocol.snap and leaves this
# file alone; a renumber, a rename, a field reorder or a changed field type
# moves a line that is recorded here and fails the prefix test.
#
# If you are here because the prefix test failed: do not edit this file.
# Restore the variant order, field order or field types you changed.

